Hey everyone!

A Plague Tale: Requiem has just been showcased at [b]The Game Awards 2022[/b], an annual awards ceremony honoring achievements in the video game industry. We're incredibly thankful to be part of such an amazing event, among so many amazing games!

[h3]For the occasion, here's [b]The Game Awards 2022 Spolight trailer[/b] showcased at the event:[/h3]
[previewyoutube=MTskFVe8P3Q;full][/previewyoutube]

[b]A Plague Tale: Requiem’s nominations at The Game Awards 2022 are:[/b]
[list][*][b]Game of the Year[/b], recognizing a game that delivers the absolute best experience across all creative and technical fields;
[*][b]Best Action/Adventure[/b], for the best action/adventure game, combining combat with traversal and puzzle solving;
[*][b]Best Narrative[/b], for outstanding storytelling and narrative development in a game;
[*][b]Best Score and Music[/b] (Olivier Derivière), for outstanding music, inclusive of score, original song and/or licensed soundtrack;
[*][b]Best Performance[/b] (Charlotte McBurney – Amicia), awarded to an individual for voice-over acting, motion and/or performance capture[/list]

Thank you so much everyone. You make us so proud.

🤎
